4.

Update every frontend authorization hook.

Replace any checks like:

isSuperAdmin

isAdmin

with

canManagePermissions()

canEditArticles()

canPublishArticles()

etc.

5.

Protect backend APIs.

Every protected endpoint must validate

resolveKbPermissions()

Never trust:

System Role alone.

